           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Branding Tips for Pflugerville Businesses",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>If you serve new neighborhoods, make your logo easy to recognize on door hangers and yard signs.</li><li>Choose a name and logo that won't be confused with nearby businesses.</li><li>Bundle your logo with business cards so your first print run is consistent.</li><li>Set up a Google Business Profile with your new logo as the profile image.</li></ul>",
