          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Is Logo Austin near Pflugerville?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin's office is at 7600 Chevy Chase Dr in North Austin, a short drive from Pflugerville. Most projects are completed by phone, text and email.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can I get a logo, website and business cards together?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. The Logo Austin Business Starter Package ($950) includes a logo, basic website and 150 business cards.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a custom logo cost for a Pflugerville business?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin charges $125 to $175 for a custom logo, with no upfront payment. You pay only after approving the final design and receive JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS files.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
